              "kind": "quote",
              "by": "Ben Daglish",
              "role": "composer",
              "paragraphs": [
                [
                  {
                    "t": "I got the phone call from Mark [Cale] asking me to write some level tunes — I wrote the music, went down there [to System 3] to meet Archer Maclean (? I think it was Arch that put the driver in…), got offered Mark Cale’s slightly-dodgy-import-status left-hand-drive BMW, said “no thanks, I’ll have the cash please” and that was that."
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "question",
              "by": null,
              "role": null,
              "paragraphs": [
                [
                  {
                    "t": "How was Anthony Lees to work with?"
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "quote",
              "by": "Ben Daglish",
              "role": "composer",
              "paragraphs": [
                [
                  {
                    "t": "Only met the guy once — on that one day — he said ‘hi’ — I said ‘hi’ — that was about it."
                  }
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "note",
              "by": null,
              "role": null,
              "paragraphs": [
                [
                  {
                    "t": "The titles of the individual tunes found below are based on as they appear in the game."
                  }
                ]
              ]
            }
